CAMPAIGN REIMAGINED

For installation or repair, go to SINGLE PLAYER > INSTANT ACTION and launch:

! SETUP / REPAIR - Open Community Patch

The setup mission verifies the bundled patch files, installs or updates OpenShim when needed, preserves your existing openshim.ini settings, and tells you if a full Battlezone restart is required.

If it says RESTART REQUIRED, completely exit Battlezone before relaunching; returning only to the main menu is not enough because winmm.dll remains loaded until the game process closes.

After setup reports complete, go to SINGLE PLAYER > CUSTOM CAMPAIGN > Campaign Reimagined to play the current early NSDF rewrites, beginning with Red Arrival. The campaign currently ends after An Unexpected Connection.

Campaign Reimagined does not need to be activated in Mods. Its maps, ODFs and asset overrides load with the selected campaign or setup mission. The installed Open Community Patch engine fixes remain available throughout Battlezone.

You can run the setup mission again at any time to verify or repair the installation.

Diagnostics: logs\openpatch_setup.log
